{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00744","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享节愍太子庙乐章 登歌酌鬯 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享节愍太子庙乐章 登歌酌鬯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灼灼重明，仰承元首。\n既贤且哲，惟孝与友。\n惟孝虽遥，灵规不朽。\n礼因诚致，备絜玄酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}